  unitName: Thunder General Ewan
  unitId: 40876
  unitNumber: 1551
  description: A general from the Kingdom of Dichmarde, one of the three most influential
    powers that served as the foundation for the Elgaia Federation. Unlike other
    allies of the kingdom which clamored for rebellion, such as the Frenbrook Republic
    and the Nuikar Tribal Alliance, Ewan advised his superiors that a friendly relationship
    with the Randall Empire would be in the best interest of their rapidly decaying
    nation. He spoke from his knowledge of the great strength of the Imperial Guard,
    and of the suffering of his people, but was nevertheless labeled a traitor. His
    king would repay his counsel by hiring the band of outlaws known as the Ten Vile
    Disnomians to take his life.
  summonDesc: I shall fight for the powerless alone. If you have sought me for your
    own personal gain, then I suggest you look elsewhere for help.
  fusionDesc: Fighting exhausts and disheartens people. I must become stronger if
    I am to end this as soon as possible.
